# "Equipped creature ... has hexproof from monocolored" (CR 702.11d): it can't be the target of monocolored spells
# its controller's opponents control, nor of abilities they control from monocolored sources. Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# (one color) can't target the equipped Dwarven Mauler - it kills the unequipped Ornithopter instead, the positive
# control - and Bot2's Lightning Helix (red and white, CR 105.2b) can. Bot1 answers with its own white Mother of Runes,
# which may target the Mauler (hexproof is about opponents, CR 702.11b): protection from red makes the Helix's only
# target illegal, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b) - the Mauler lives and Bot2 gains no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Dwarven Mauler
Mox Jet
Dragonfire Blade
Mox Pearl
Mother of Runes
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Helix
Island
Island
Island x10

